{"id":"n58792-1-8","stage":3,"title":"벨트 · 腰带","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58792-1-8-1","ko":"원피스가 좀 펑퍼짐한 느낌인데요?","zh":"这条连衣裙看起来有点宽松吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"원피스가","meaning":"连衣裙","explanation":"원피스：连衣裙；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"원피스","audio":"/audio/3d8a55e85748680559d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26721","senseId":"1","lemma":"원피스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"원피스가","audio":"/audio/2369f676ef712c392bf7.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"펑퍼짐한","meaning":"宽松，宽大（衣服）","explanation":"펑퍼짐하다：宽松，宽大（衣服）；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"펑퍼짐하다","audio":"/audio/2fcaa9e921951b953e04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81948","senseId":"1","lemma":"펑퍼짐하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"펑퍼짐한","audio":"/audio/f428890c412f36cf338e.mp3"}},{"text":"느낌인데요?","meaning":"感觉，感受","explanation":"느낌：感觉，感受；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"느낌","audio":"/audio/f376240a37fbad9834c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61166","senseId":"1","lemma":"느낌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"느낌인데요","audio":"/audio/cfaaa3b01cb411c9c3bc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3d8a55e857486805","term":"원피스","zh":"连衣裙","audio":"/audio/3d8a55e85748680559d0.mp3","entryId":"26721","definition":"上衣和裙子一体的女性衣服。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"2fcaa9e921951b95","term":"펑퍼짐하다","zh":"宽松，宽大（衣服）","audio":"/audio/2fcaa9e921951b953e04.mp3","entryId":"81948","definition":"宽松，宽大（衣服）","pronunciation":["펑퍼짐하다"]},{"id":"f376240a37fbad98","term":"느낌","zh":"感觉，感受","audio":"/audio/f376240a37fbad9834c5.mp3","entryId":"61166","definition":"身体或内心产生的情绪或情感。","pronunciation":["느낌"]}],"audio":"/audio/3f10fc3eff2ec97ee272.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58792-1-8-2","ko":"그러면 허리에 벨트를 하시면 더 나을 거예요.","zh":"那样的话，在腰间系条腰带会更好哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러면","meaning":"那么，那样的话","explanation":"그러면：那么，那样的话","readings":[{"term":"그러면","audio":"/audio/25763f89d255f1256055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58276","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러면","audio":"/audio/25763f89d255f1256055.mp3"}},{"text":"허리에","meaning":"腰","explanation":"허리：腰；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"허리","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30201","senseId":"1","lemma":"허리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"허리에","audio":"/audio/b608273b27b4357bd195.mp3"}},{"text":"벨트를","meaning":"腰带","explanation":"벨트：腰带；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"벨트","audio":"/audio/e81ed49257b94b4ef783.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58792","senseId":"1","lemma":"벨트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벨트를","audio":"/audio/1c2aa20886a9f1be5473.mp3"}},{"text":"하시면","meaning":"佩戴，穿衣打扮，置办，置备","explanation":"하다：佩戴，穿衣打扮，置办，置备；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"5","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하시면","audio":"/audio/133e2e7c7aa6a7e1ab62.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"나을","meaning":"更好，胜过","explanation":"낫다：更好，胜过；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"낫다","audio":"/audio/fde5eb6648ee9db93798.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38524","senseId":"1","lemma":"낫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나을","audio":"/audio/ed6425096c2f0dffe45d.mp3"}},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거예요","audio":"/audio/ce83694d33e9399b0229.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"25763f89d255f125","term":"그러면","zh":"那么，那样的话","audio":"/audio/25763f89d255f1256055.mp3","entryId":"58276","definition":"用于表示前文为后文的条件。","pronunciation":["그러면"]},{"id":"777cb8e222698603","term":"허리","zh":"腰","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3","entryId":"30201","definition":"人或动物身体上从肋骨下方到尾骨的部分。","pronunciation":["허리"]},{"id":"e81ed49257b94b4e","term":"벨트","zh":"腰带","audio":"/audio/e81ed49257b94b4ef783.mp3","entryId":"58792","definition":"束在衣服腰部的带子。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"佩戴，穿衣打扮，置办，置备","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"把首饰等戴在身上或穿衣服等。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"fde5eb6648ee9db9","term":"낫다","zh":"更好，胜过","audio":"/audio/fde5eb6648ee9db93798.mp3","entryId":"38524","definition":"相比之下，比别的好。","pronunciation":["낟ː따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/e87536b4a595908cdbcf.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58792","label"